  "zero_parameter_ambient_time_field_closure": {
    "physical_mechanism": "The proper-time field phi fills all space as a continuous ambient scalar medium (A(phi) > 0 everywhere). Ordinary atoms (omega_b) create local clock-rate slopes governed by the single two-branch equation nabla.[P_{,X}(|nabla u|) nabla u] = beta_A rho_b with P_{,X} = k sqrt(xi) + 2 xi (k = 16.03 fixed by a_0, zero free parameters). At the sound horizon r_s, the enclosed atomic acceleration ratio q_s = Omega_b (H_0 r_s / c) ~ 1.60e-3 gives two-branch clock-slope response y_s = 7.42-7.44 and total well-driving multiplier M_s = 1 + y_s / sqrt(2) = 6.25-6.26. Because photons have trace-free stress-energy (T^mu_mu = 0) and do not source phi, while the rolling ambient field carries timelike inertia K_t = 2k + 6 = 38.06 during acoustic oscillations (dot(Phi) != 0), the extra clock-slope pull omega_phi = omega_b (y_s / sqrt(2)) = 0.1179-0.1182 holds the acoustic potential wells steady through horizon entry without particulate dark matter or an ad-hoc condensate species. Here g_t = Lambda_X^2 / (sqrt(2) M_Pl) = c H_0 / 2 is a fixed constant of the scalar action S_phi (and q_s = g_b(r_s)/g_t = Omega_b(H_0 r_s / c) is conformally invariant under A(phi)). The single-pass analytic sound-horizon estimate (r_s = 146.19 Mpc, q_s = 1.62e-3, y_s = 7.38, omega_phi = 0.1166) refines under self-consistent fixed-point iteration of r_s(omega_phi) in hi_class to r_s = 144.94-145.00 Mpc, y_s = 7.42-7.44, omega_phi = 0.1179-0.1182 (spanning 0.1174-0.1199 across H_0 in [67.4, 70.0] km/s/Mpc under the same self-consistent r_s fixed-point iteration, all within <= 1.6 sigma of the Planck TTTEEE posterior 0.11813 +/- 0.00117). On linear cosmological scales (k <= 0.2 h/Mpc, R >= 10 Mpc, governing BAO and sigma_8), the scale-averaged multiplier M_s = 1 + y_s/sqrt(2) enters the linear Poisson equation identically to omega_m,eff = omega_b + omega_phi, whereas inside nonlinear virialized halos (R <= 100 kpc, dot(Phi) -> 0, g_N >= g_t) the same nonlinear operator (k/sqrt(2)) q y^2 + q^2 y^3 = 1 screens down to the static baryon-only RAR/lensing law without forming an independent collisionless NFW dark-matter halo cusp.",
